#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:98
#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:138
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Important"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:98
msgid ""
"In order to proxy VMware vCenter Cloud traffic through a Distributed "
"Worker, you must have a static public DNS entry for the internal IP "
"address of the vCenter appliance. If this is not done, everything may "
"appear to be working properly when configuring the Cloud but problems "
"will arise at provision time. This is not a |morpheus| limitation but is "
"a limitation of the VMware SDK client which does not natively support "
"proxies."
msgstr "Pour faire transiter le trafic Cloud VMware vCenter via un Worker distribué, vous devez disposer d'une entrée DNS publique statique pour l'adresse IP interne de l'appliance vCenter. Si ce n'est pas fait, tout peut sembler fonctionner correctement lors de la configuration du Cloud, mais des problèmes surviendront au moment du provisionnement. Il ne s'agit pas d'une limitation |morpheus|, mais d'une limitation du client SDK VMware qui ne prend pas nativement en charge les proxys."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:100
msgid ""
"Download the appropriate package from |morpheus| Hub based on your target"
" Linux distribution and version for installation in a directory of your "
"choosing. The package can be removed after successful installation."
msgstr "Téléchargez le paquet approprié depuis |morpheus| Hub en fonction de votre distribution et version Linux cibles pour l'installation dans un répertoire de votre choix. Le paquet peut être supprimé après une installation réussie."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:102
msgid ""
"wget https://downloads.morpheusdata.com/path/to/morpheus-"
"worker-$version.distro"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:106
msgid ""
"Validate the package checksum as compared with the values indicated on "
"Hub. For example:"
msgstr "Validez la somme de contrôle du paquet par rapport aux valeurs indiquées sur Hub. Par exemple :"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:108
msgid "sha256sum morpheus-worker-$version.distro"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:112
msgid ""
"Next, install the package using your selected distribution's package "
"installation command and your preferred options. Example, for RPM:"
msgstr "Ensuite, installez le paquet à l'aide de la commande d'installation de paquets de votre distribution sélectionnée et de vos options préférées. Exemple, pour RPM :"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:114
msgid "**rpm**:"
msgstr "**rpm** :"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:116
msgid ""
"$ sudo rpm -ihv morpheus-worker-$version.$distro\n"
"\n"
"Preparing...                          ################################# "
"[100%]\n"
"Updating / installing...\n"
"   1:morpheus-worker-x.x.x-1.$distro    #################################"
" [100%]\n"
"Thank you for installing Morpheus Worker!\n"
"Configure and start the Worker by running the following command:\n"
"\n"
"sudo morpheus-worker-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:129
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:131
msgid ""
"With the package installed, we need to add a new distributed worker in "
"|morpheus| UI. Distributed workers are added in |AdmIntDis|. To create "
"one, populate the following fields:"
msgstr "Une fois le paquet installé, nous devons ajouter un nouveau Worker distribué dans l'interface |morpheus|. Les Workers distribués sont ajoutés dans |AdmIntDis|. Pour en créer un, renseignez les champs suivants :"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:133
msgid "**NAME:** A name for the distributed worker in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME :** Un nom pour le Worker distribué dans |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:134
msgid "**DESCRIPTION:** An optional description for the distributed worker"
msgstr "**DESCRIPTION :** Une description optionnelle pour le Worker distribué"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:135
msgid ""
"**PROXY HOSTS:** A comma-delimited list of global proxy hosts, any "
"endpoint listed here will be proxied through the |morpheus| worker. For "
"VMware, you must list the host addresses for any vCenter you wish to "
"proxy through the worker. Xen hosts and PowerVC hosts must be listed here"
" as well. Other Cloud types which are supported by the |morpheus| worker "
"need only have the worker configured on the Edit Cloud modal (|InfClo| > "
"Selected Cloud > Edit button)"
msgstr "**PROXY HOSTS :** Une liste délimitée par des virgules d'hôtes proxy globaux ; tout point de terminaison répertorié ici sera proxifié via le Worker |morpheus|. Pour VMware, vous devez répertorier les adresses d'hôte de tout vCenter que vous souhaitez proxifier via le Worker. Les hôtes Xen et PowerVC doivent également être répertoriés ici. Pour les autres types de Cloud pris en charge par le Worker |morpheus|, il suffit de configurer le Worker dans la fenêtre modale Modifier le Cloud (|InfClo| > Cloud sélectionné > bouton Modifier)"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:136
msgid "**ENABLED:** When marked, the selected worker is available for use"
msgstr "**ENABLED :** Lorsqu'il est coché, le Worker sélectionné est disponible"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:138
msgid ""
"The proxy host URL entered in the Worker configuration must match the URL"
" set in the Cloud configuration. That is, if you use the URL in the Cloud"
" configuration you must also use it in the Worker configuration. The "
"reverse is also true, if an IP address is used in the Cloud "
"configuration, that should be used in the Worker configuration as well. "
"There are also configuration considerations that must be made for "
"proxying vCenter Cloud traffic through a Distributed Worker. See the "
"\"IMPORTANT\" box in the \"Requirements\" section for additional details."
msgstr "L'URL d'hôte proxy saisie dans la configuration Worker doit correspondre à l'URL définie dans la configuration Cloud. Autrement dit, si vous utilisez l'URL dans la configuration Cloud, vous devez également l'utiliser dans la configuration Worker. L'inverse est également vrai : si une adresse IP est utilisée dans la configuration Cloud, elle doit également être utilisée dans la configuration Worker. Des considérations de configuration doivent également être prises en compte pour proxifier le trafic Cloud vCenter via un Worker distribué. Consultez l'encadré « IMPORTANT » dans la section « Exigences » pour plus de détails."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:140
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`, an API key is generated and "
"displayed. Make note of this as it will be needed in a later "
"configuration step."
msgstr "Après avoir cliqué sur :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`, une clé API est générée et affichée. Notez-la, car elle sera nécessaire lors d'une étape de configuration ultérieure."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:142
msgid ".. image:: /images/worker/createWorker.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:144
msgid ""
"With the worker configured in |morpheus|, the next step is to update "
"supported Cloud integrations which should be proxied through the worker. "
"Select the desired Cloud from the Clouds List Page (|InfClo|) and click "
":guilabel:`EDIT` from the chosen Cloud's Detail Page. Within the "
"Connection Options section, choose a configured worker from the WORKER "
"dropdown menu. Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."
msgstr "Une fois le Worker configuré dans |morpheus|, l'étape suivante consiste à mettre à jour les intégrations Cloud prises en charge qui doivent être proxifiées via le Worker. Sélectionnez le Cloud souhaité depuis la page liste des Clouds (|InfClo|) et cliquez sur :guilabel:`EDIT` depuis la page de détails du Cloud choisi. Dans la section Options de connexion, choisissez un Worker configuré dans le menu déroulant WORKER. Cliquez sur :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:146
msgid ".. image:: /images/worker/addWorkerToCloud.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:149
msgid ""
"With the API key in hand and configuration complete in |morpheus| UI, "
"head back to the worker box. Configure the gateway by editing "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-worker.rb`` and updating the following:"
msgstr "Avec la clé API en main et la configuration terminée dans l'interface |morpheus|, retournez sur la machine Worker. Configurez la passerelle en modifiant ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-worker.rb`` et en mettant à jour les éléments suivants :"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:151
msgid "**Distributed Worker or witness only:**"
msgstr "**Worker distribué ou témoin uniquement :**"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:153
msgid ""
"worker_url = 'https://worker.example.com'\n"
"worker['appliance_url'] = 'https://morpheus.example.com'\n"
"worker['worker_key'] = 'DISTRIBUTED WORKER KEY'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:159
msgid "**Console or VDI gateway only:**"
msgstr "**Passerelle console ou VDI uniquement :**"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:161
msgid ""
"worker_url = 'https://worker.example.com'\n"
"worker['appliance_url'] = 'https://morpheus.example.com'\n"
"worker['apikey'] = 'VDI GATEWAY API KEY'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:167
#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:263
msgid "**Combined Distributed Worker and gateway roles:**"
msgstr "**Rôles Worker distribué et passerelle combinés :**"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:169
msgid ""
"worker_url = 'https://worker.example.com' # URL used to reach this Worker"
"\n"
"worker['appliance_url'] = 'https://morpheus_appliance_url' # The "
"resolvable URL or IP address of Morpheus appliance which the worker can "
"reach on port 443\n"
"worker['apikey'] = 'VDI GATEWAY API KEY'\n"
"worker['worker_key'] = 'DISTRIBUTED WORKER KEY' # Distributed Worker API "
"Key from Administration > Integrations > Distributed Workers "
"configuration\n"
"worker['proxy_address'] = 'http://proxy.address:1234' # For environments "
"in which the worker must go through a proxy to communicate with the "
"Morpheus appliance or other resources, configure the address\n"
"worker['no_proxy'] = 'vcenter.example.com,192.168.xx.xx' # A comma-"
"separated list of resources that should be accessed directly and not "
"through the proxy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:178
msgid ""
"``worker_url`` identifies the Worker service. ``worker['appliance_url']``"
" identifies the |morpheus| appliance. Do not interchange them. By "
"default, ``worker_url`` uses the Worker's hostname. For gateway or "
"witness use, set it to a stable URL that every required client can "
"resolve, reach, and trust."
msgstr "``worker_url`` identifie le service Worker. ``worker['appliance_url']`` identifie l'appliance |morpheus|. Ne les intervertissez pas. Par défaut, ``worker_url`` utilise le nom d'hôte du Worker. Pour une utilisation passerelle ou témoin, définissez-le sur une URL stable que chaque client requis peut résoudre, atteindre et approuver."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:180
msgid ""
"After all configuration options have been set, run ``sudo morpheus-"
"worker-ctl reconfigure`` to install and configure the worker, nginx and "
"guacd services:"
msgstr "Une fois toutes les options de configuration définies, exécutez ``sudo morpheus-worker-ctl reconfigure`` pour installer et configurer les services Worker, nginx et guacd :"

